0..75 Comment "// Two protocols that differ only in how their messages are encoded are one"
76..149 Comment "// type, once each pair of payload types that differ is paid with a path:"
150..225 Comment "// bisimilarity up to an equivalence of the payloads, the paths the session"
226..300 Comment "// certificate carries to the kernel (Gay and Hole, _Subtyping for Session"
301..368 Comment "// Types in the Pi Calculus_, doi:10.1007/s00236-005-0177-z, relate"
369..438 Comment "// payloads by type equality; the path generalises the equality to an"
439..455 Comment "// equivalence)."
